5. Summary of Key Components
Component	Role
kubelet	Detects pod/container status, runs pods
API Server	Central hub for cluster state, stores in etcd
etcd	Stores cluster state (source of truth)
Controller Manager	Watches API Server, ensures desired state, creates pod specs
Scheduler	Assigns pods to nodes based on resources
kube-proxy	Handles service networking (iptables/IPVS)
Deployment	Manages multiple replicas of pods
HPA	Scales pods based on metrics
Metrics Server	Provides metrics for HPA
Cluster Autoscaler	Scales nodes up/down based on unschedulable pods
Ingress Controller	Routes external traffic based on Ingress rules
Service	Virtual abstraction for pod grouping and routing

